        <li>Pick the meaning: ability (<span class="de">können</span>), necessity (<span class="de">müssen</span>), intention (<span class="de">wollen</span>), duty/instruction (<span class="de">sollen</span>), permission (<span class="de">dürfen</span>), polite wish (<span class="de">möchten</span>).</li>
